WEBVTT

00:02:29.636 --> 00:02:33.196
trapped their methane burps.

00:02:33.236 --> 00:02:34.956
(Laughter)

00:02:34.996 --> 00:02:38.356
In that first experiment,

00:02:38.356 --> 00:02:41.996
the emissions were reduced
by up to 67 percent.

00:02:43.716 --> 00:02:47.796
(Applause)

00:02:48.196 --> 00:02:49.956
And I thought at first,

00:02:49.996 --> 00:02:53.156
the equipment must have
malfunctioned, but it was real.

00:02:53.756 --> 00:02:56.836
But we are left with more
questions than answers.

00:02:57.276 --> 00:03:00.956
Would the microbes
in the gut get used to it